	<key>PayloadType</key>
	<string>Configuration</string>
	<key>PayloadVersion</key>
	<integer>1</integer>
	<key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
	<string>io.github.studyreadbook4ever.howToSafeDNS</string>
	<key>PayloadUUID</key>
	<string>07A98D33-17BB-5601-9649-01B3F8F3A6FA</string>
	<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
	<string>howToSafeDNS · Google Public DNS · DoH</string>
	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>This file contains a single DNS configuration only. It does not include a root certificate, VPN, device management enrollment or app installation. You can inspect the XML source on GitHub.

The profile is unsigned. “Unsigned” means it has no distributor signature; this is separate from the DNS connection's TLS encryption. Check the name and DNS addresses on the installation screen before deciding to install.

General resolution · Not a malicious-site blocking service

The provider states that personal data collected through DNS is not used for advertising targeting. Temporary logs containing IP addresses and queries are usually kept for 24–48 hours; there are security and abuse-response exceptions and long-term de-identified logs.

Privacy policy: https://developers.google.com/speed/public-dns/privacy</string>
	<key>PayloadScope</key>
	<string>System</string>
	<key>PayloadContent</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>PayloadType</key>
			<string>com.apple.dnsSettings.managed</string>
